</header>

<!-- ── Mobile Nav Drawer ──────────────────────────────────── -->
<nav class="mobile-nav" id="mobileNav" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
  <a href="#about">About Us</a>
  <a href="#disaster-relief">Disaster Relief</a>
  <a href="#programs">Programs &amp; Services</a>
  <a href="#volunteer">Volunteer</a>
  <a href="#find-chapter">Find Local Chapter</a>
  <a href="#donate-cta">Donate</a>
  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-donate" onclick="openDonateModal()">Donate</button>
  <div class="utility-links">
    <a href="#">Sign In</a>
    <a href="#">Contact Us</a>
    <a href="#">Español</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>

<!-- ── Hero ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>When Disaster Strikes, We're There</h1>
      <p>From hurricanes and wildfires to global health emergencies, Global Aid Alliance delivers immediate relief and long-term recovery support to communities in crisis.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-white" onclick="openDonateModal()">Donate Now</button>
        <a href="#get-involved" class="btn btn-outline">Become a Volunteer</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Mission ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section mission" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">Our Mission</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Humanity First, Always</h2>
    <p class="mission-highlight">Global Aid Alliance prevents and alleviates human suffering in the face of emergencies by mobilizing the power of volunteers and the generosity of donors.</p>
    <p class="section-body">We are guided by the fundamental principles of humanity, impartiality, and neutrality. Every day, our teams work across borders and boundaries to ensure that help reaches those who need it most — regardless of race, religion, nationality, or political affiliation. From the first hours of a disaster to the years of recovery that follow, we stand with affected communities every step of the way.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Impact Statistics ───────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section impact-stats">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8)">Our Impact</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">The Scale of Our Work</h2>
    <p class="section-body">These figures represent real lives changed — families sheltered after storms, blood delivered to hospitals, and communities rebuilt stronger than before.</p>
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number" data-target="12" data-suffix="M" data-prefix="">0M</div>
        <div class="stat-label">people assisted annually</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number" data-target="50000" data-suffix="" data-prefix="" data-format="comma">0</div>
        <div class="stat-label">active volunteers across our network</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number" data-target="190" data-suffix="" data-prefix="" data-format="">0</div>
        <div class="stat-label">countries where we've provided aid</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number" data-target="850" data-suffix="M" data-prefix="$">$0M</div>
        <div class="stat-label">raised in the last fiscal year</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Programs ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section" id="programs">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">Programs &amp; Services</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">How We Help</h2>
    <p class="section-body">Our programs span immediate crisis response to long-term community resilience — because recovery doesn't happen overnight.</p>
    <div class="accordion" id="programAccordion">
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
          Disaster Relief
          <span class="accordion-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>Rapid deployment of emergency shelter, food, water, and medical supplies to communities affected by natural disasters and conflict. Our response teams are on the ground within 24 hours.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
          Blood Donation
          <span class="accordion-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>Operating one of the largest blood collection networks, we supply approximately 40% of the nation's blood and blood products to hospitals and medical facilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
          Emergency Preparedness
          <span class="accordion-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>Training individuals, families, and organizations to prepare for and respond to emergencies through workshops, certification courses, and community drills.</p>
        </div>
